{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Once upon a time, in the pacific northwest...</i><br><br>Departure is an management sim set in the air traffic control tower of a small, regional airport. Players are tasked with directing incoming and outgoing flights during the normally quiet night shift. Inspired by 90's pulp media like Outer Limits, Twilight Zone, Twin Peaks, and X-Files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Management Sim: </strong>Direct incoming and outgoing flights at Ganlley Airport using radar, runways, and your own best judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Controls: </strong>Move objects and interact with the world using physics inspired by titles like Garry\u2019s Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Evening Dreary:</strong> Let narrative events unfold while you engage with your work. See how your actions unfold the evening\u2019s mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537220?t=1740182889","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740182889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537220/de0ba22e261c54c910bc34617171852d6a769328/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740182889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537220/de0ba22e261c54c910bc34617171852d6a769328/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740182889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Once upon a time, in the pacific northwest...</i><br><br>Departure is an management sim set in the air traffic control tower of a small, regional airport. Players are tasked with directing incoming and outgoing flights during the normally quiet night shift. Inspired by 90's pulp media like Outer Limits, Twilight Zone, Twin Peaks, and X-Files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Management Sim: </strong>Direct incoming and outgoing flights at Ganlley Airport using radar, runways, and your own best judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Controls: </strong>Move objects and interact with the world using physics inspired by titles like Garry\u2019s Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Evening Dreary:</strong> Let narrative events unfold while you engage with your work. See how your actions unfold the evening\u2019s mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Diver 2 Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537220/header.jpg?t=1740182889","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Departure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Diver 2 Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache\n\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537220/ss_83b689fb7cc9f555f9d1d5ce5bc018c6f1e5ca58.1920x1080.jpg?t=17401